# The repository root has no index page; the demo lives under demo/. Send the
# root there with a 302 (not a 301, so the root can become a real page later
# without fighting browser caches). A rewrite (200) would break the demo's
# relative script and stylesheet URLs, which resolve against demo/.
/        /demo/demo-standalone.html   302
/demo    /demo/demo-standalone.html   302
/20x     /demo/demo-20x.html          302
